From 71e8c964ebbd0fa9dbe003e153b0fd749ebbec66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeevaa-K <jeeva4593430@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 11:30:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Polish: favicon/meta tags, full a11y pass, kill dead PWA
 files, tighten CSP
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add real favicon set (SVG + PNG) and wire it into index.html + manifest.json
  (manifest referenced /favicon.png which never existed)
- Add meta description, Open Graph, and Twitter card tags for link previews
- Remove dead files: theme.js (a comment-only stub) and sw.js (never
  registered anywhere — index.html only ever unregisters service workers)
- Migrate all remaining inline onclick= handlers (mobile back buttons,
  recurring type toggle, auth tabs, password-eye toggles, demo login) to
  addEventListener via data-action delegation, matching the rest of the app
- Tighten CSP: scriptSrcAttr 'unsafe-inline' -> 'none' now that no inline
  event-handler attributes remain, closing off an XSS vector
- Add ARIA roles/states throughout: dialog/aria-modal on all 5 modals,
  tablist/tab/tabpanel on auth and profile tabs, aria-expanded on the
  hamburger and avatar dropdown, aria-label on icon-only buttons,
  role=alert on auth error text, autocomplete hints on auth inputs
